---
title: "FIG. 65-02: Sync Protocol Flow"
patent: EGS-65
---
sequenceDiagram
    participant P as Primary
    participant R1 as Replica 1
    participant R2 as Replica 2
    
    P->>R1: Push Delta
    P->>R2: Push Delta
    R1->>R1: Apply Changes
    R2->>R2: Apply Changes
    R1->>P: ACK + Vector Clock
    R2->>P: ACK + Vector Clock
    P->>P: Update Sync State
    
    Note over P,R2: Conflict Detection
    R1->>P: Conflicting Update
    P->>P: Resolve Conflict
    P->>R1: Merged State
    P->>R2: Merged State
